  "explanation": "The question asks when the PMK (Pattali Makkal Katchi) was founded. Document D1S4 explicitly states that 'PMK was founded by S. Ramadoss, an activist, on 16 July 1989.' This provides a direct and unambiguous answer. The other candidate, '1981,' refers to the founding year of the People's Movement of Kosovo (LPK) in document D2S1, which is a different entity and unrelated to the PMK in Tamil Nadu. Therefore, '16 July 1989' is the only valid and supported answer."
}
